        {
          "text": "ati Ni mugende munsigurize Uhoraho, twe n’amasigarira yo mu Bisirayeli no mu Bayuda, ivy’ amajambo yo mur’ ico gitabo batoye; kuk’ uburake bg’Uhoraho budusutsweko ari bginshi, kubga ba sogokuruza batumviye ijambo ry’Uhoraho, ngo bakore ivyanditswe mur’ iki gitabo vyose.",
          "type": "text",
