        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Hilukiya n’abo bandi umwami yatumye, baragenda, baja k’ūvugishwa n’Imana Hulida muka Shalumu, Shalumu mwene Tokihati, umwuzukuru wa Hasira, yajejwe ububīko bg’imyambaro, bamusiguza ivyo. Kand’ uwo mugore yaba i Yerusalemu mu gice caho ca kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
