        {
          "text": "mut’ Uhoraho agize ngw Azotēza ivyago aha hantu, bo n’abahaba, ngo Ni yo mivumo yose yanditswe mur’ ico gitabo bagusomeye, wewe nyene umwami w’i Buyuda; ",
