          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Nukw azoguha guhambga hamwe na ba sogokuruza, ushike mu mva yawe amahoro; ngo Kand’ amaso yawe ntazobona ivyo vyago vyose azotēza aha hantu n’abahaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
