              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 15:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami ahagarara ahantu yamenyereye, asezeranira imbere y’Uhoraho kw azomukurikira, no kuzokwitondera ivyagezwe vyiwe n’amabgirizwa yiwe n’ivyo yashinze, no kuzovyitonderesha umutima wiwe wose n’ubugingo bgiwe bgose, no kuzoshitsa amajambo y’iryo sezerano yanditswe mur’ ico gitabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araheza yemeza iryo sezerano ababa i Yerusalemu n’Ababenyamini bose. Nukw ab’i Yerusalemu bashitsa iryo sezerano ry’ Imana, ari yo Mana ya ba sekuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yosiya akūra ibizira vyose vy’ubuyobe mu ntāra zose z’Abisirayeli, yemeza abari mu gihugu c’i Bgisirayeli bose gusaba Uhoraho Imana ya ba sekuruza. Igihe cose yamaze akiriho nta ho bāretse gukurikira Uhoraho, Imana ya ba sekuruza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
